    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Plus-sized Misadventures in Love! (2025)",
        "jpn": "デブとラブと過ちと！"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "\"This is my punishment - someone as hideous as me falling for someone as good-looking as you...\" Yumeko had a mountain of complexes about herself. Then, a terrible accident befalls her. Though somehow saved from the brink of death, Yumeko wakes up a completely different person. \"Is this...me...?! I'm SUPER cute!!\" Those around her can't hide their surprise and wonderment at this 180-degree change... But, Yumeko's new hyper-positive attitude starts to change her surroundings, too. Worries and complexes can affect anyone, and Yumeko will chop right through those of her various supporting characters!! In love, work, friendship... And an attempted murder case?! This frenzied romantic comedy will leave you bubbling with energy!",
        "jpn": "お菓子メーカーに勤める夢子は、\r\n事故をきっかけに記憶喪失になってしまう。\r\nコンプレックスの塊で自分が嫌いで仕方のなかった夢子は、\r\n目が覚めると超ポジティブで\r\n自己肯定感MAXな性格になっていた。\r\n\r\n元の性格とは正反対な夢子に、周りは戸惑いを隠せずにいたが、\r\n夢子のポジティブでまっすぐな姿に少しずつ変化が訪れて――。\r\n恋に、仕事に、友情に！ちょっとだけ事件の香りも……？"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Debu to Love to Ayamachi to!",
        "デブラブ"
    ],
